				<p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Devuelven un vector (Nc x 1), [J/mol K]</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Ambas entropías en exceso están referidas a la entropía del GAS PURO S<sub>i</sub>
					<sup>0</sup>
				</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">s(x,T,P)<sub>i</sub> = S<sub>i</sub>
					<sup>0</sup> (T,P) - R ln(x<sub>i</sub>) + s<sup>ex.SRK</sup>
					<sub>i</sub>
				</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">S(x,T,P)<sub>i</sub> = S<sub>i</sub>
					<sup>0</sup> (T,P) - R ln(x<sub>i</sub>) + S<sup>ex.SRK</sup>
					<sub>i</sub>
