					<sub>i</sub>
				</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">H<sub>i</sub> = H<sub>i</sub>
					<sup>0</sup> (T, 1 atm) + ΔH<sup>SRK.puro</sup>
					<sub>i</sub>
