				<p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Ambas entropías están referidas a la entropía del GAS IDEAL PURO H<sub>i</sub>
					<sup>0</sup>
				</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">s(T,P)<sub>i</sub> = S<sub>i</sub>
					<sup>0</sup> (T, 1 atm) + Δs<sup>SRK.puro</sup>
					<sub>i</sub>
				</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="inherit" text-align="left" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">S(T,P)<sub>i</sub> = S<sub>i</sub>
					<sup>0</sup> (T, 1 atm) + ΔS<sup>SRK.puro</sup>
